  "description": "Shared abstractions for the SharpAstro image codec family: IImageDecoder (magic-byte sniff + fidelity/zero-copy decode) and IDecodedImage / RasterImage (a codec-neutral decoded raster). Ships the ITU-T H.273 colour vocabulary (ColorPrimaries / TransferFunction / MatrixCoefficients) and a ColorEncoding record surfacing what decoded samples mean (sRGB, PQ/HLG HDR, linear light). AOT-compatible, zero runtime dependencies.",
